  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH AuthMux",
      "text": "> One login plane. Many model subscriptions.\n\n[简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nAuthMux is a DSH-native OAuth multiplexer. It puts subscription-backed model providers behind one compact sign-in surface, while DeepSeek Harness Core continues to own credentials, settings, model routes, and token refresh."
    },
    {
      "section": "Why AuthMux",
      "text": "- **One surface** for every OAuth flow registered by DSH Core.\n- **No private credential store** — grants live in `dsh-credentials-local`.\n- **No duplicate model adapter** — requests stay on Core `llm-pi-ai`.\n- **No custom HTTP server** — the browser uses loopback-fenced DSH Connection RPC.\n- **Provider differences stay provider-owned** — browser callbacks, device codes, PKCE, and refresh logic remain inside the Core flow."
    },
    {
      "section": "Why AuthMux",
      "text": "OpenAI Codex is pinned first. The current DSH Core catalog also exposes OAuth flows for Anthropic, GitHub Copilot, Kimi For Coding, OpenRouter, and xAI."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:Q-xuan/dsh-authmux\ndsh --profile web\n```\n\nOpen **Settings → AuthMux**, sign in, and select the enabled model from DSH's normal model picker."
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "```text\nAuthMux UI\n   │  DSH Connection RPC (loopback only)\n   ▼\nDSH AuthorizationService ──► provider-owned OAuth flow\n\nAuthMux owns only the browser interaction bridge and the UI. It does not own model transport or OAuth token refresh."
    },
    {
      "section": "Migration from dsh-simple-oauth",
      "text": "On first start, AuthMux detects `$DSH_HOME/simple-oauth.json`, imports valid credentials into `llm-pi-ai/<provider>` Core records, enables their model routes, and renames the legacy file to `simple-oauth.json.migrated` as a recovery backup."
    },
    {
      "section": "Security",
      "text": "- OAuth payloads never cross into the browser.\n- Refresh runs inside Core's serialized `modifyRecord()` path.\n- The AuthMux RPC channel is restricted to loopback authority.\n- Model tools cannot call the authorization surface.\n\nTreat every provider subscription according to that provider's terms and billing rules."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```sh\nnpm ci\nnpm run verify\n```\n\n`verify` runs TypeScript checks, tests, Host and Web builds, and a package dry run."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH AuthMux",
      "text": "> 一个登录入口，复用多家模型订阅。\n\n[English](README.md)\n\nAuthMux 是一个 DSH 原生 OAuth multiplexer。它把多家订阅模型的登录集中到一个设置页面，同时让 DeepSeek Harness Core 继续负责凭据、设置、模型路由与 Token 刷新。"
    },
    {
      "section": "为什么是 AuthMux",
      "text": "- 所有 DSH Core OAuth flow 共用一个登录界面。\n- 不维护私有凭据文件，grant 写入 `dsh-credentials-local`。\n- 不重复实现模型适配器，请求继续走 Core `llm-pi-ai`。\n- 不自建 HTTP 服务，浏览器通过 DSH Connection RPC 通信并限制为 loopback。\n- 浏览器回调、设备码、PKCE 与刷新逻辑仍由 provider flow 自己负责。\n\nOpenAI Codex 固定置顶。当前 DSH Core 还提供 Anthropic、GitHub Copilot、Kimi For Coding、OpenRouter 和 xAI 的 OAuth flow。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:Q-xuan/dsh-authmux\ndsh --profile web\n```\n\n打开 **设置 → AuthMux**，登录后从 DSH 原生模型选择器选择对应模型。"
    },
    {
      "section": "从 dsh-simple-oauth 迁移",
      "text": "首次启动时，AuthMux 会读取 `$DSH_HOME/simple-oauth.json`，将有效凭据迁移为 `llm-pi-ai/<provider>` Core record，启用模型路由，并把旧文件改名为 `simple-oauth.json.migrated` 作为恢复备份。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安全边界",
      "text": "- OAuth payload 不会传给浏览器。\n- Token 刷新运行在 Core `modifyRecord()` 的串行写路径中。\n- AuthMux RPC 固定为 loopback authority。\n- 模型工具无法调用登录入口。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```sh\nnpm ci\nnpm run verify\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
